"Welcome to Launchy" = "Karibu Launchy";
"This SwiftUI scaffold is ready for your ideas." = "Mfumo huu wa SwiftUI umeandaliwa kwa mawazo yako.";
"Increase Counter" = "Ongeza kielekezi";
"Counter: %lld" = "Kielekezi: %lld";
"Floaty or fullscreen" = "Floaty au skrini nzima";
"Pick the layout that fits the moment. Floaty hovers above your desktop, while fullscreen feels like classic Launchpad." = "Chagua muundo unaofaa wakati huo. Floaty inaleta dirisha juu ya desktop yako, wakati skrini nzima inahisi kama Launchpad ya klasik.";
"Floaty mode" = "Hali ya Floaty";
"A panel that stays light and quick. Hide the Dock icon if you want a minimal feel." = "Paneli inayobaki nyepesi na haraka. Ficha ikoni ya Dock ikiwa unataka muonekano mwepesi.";
"Fullscreen mode" = "Hali ya skrini nzima";
"Fill the screen for a focused, grid-first workflow." = "Jaza skrini kwa mtiririko wa kazi unaolenga na mtandao.";
"Flip instantly" = "Badilisha mara moja";
"Add a layout toggle shortcut in Settings to jump between modes anytime." = "Ongeza njia ya mkato ya kubadilisha muundo katika Mipangilio ili kusogea hali yoyote wakati wowote.";
"Hotkeys you control" = "Maknoboa unayodhibiti";
"Launchy ships with Cmd+Shift+Space, but you can set your own shortcuts in Settings > Keyboard." = "Launchy huja na Cmd+Shift+Space, lakini unaweza kuweka njia zako katika Mipangilio > Kibodi.";
"Toggle Launchy anywhere" = "Badilisha Launchy mahali popote";
"Record the shortcut you want to open or hide the launcher." = "Rekodi njia ya mkato unayotaka kufungua au kuficha chombo.";
"Layout toggle" = "Kubadilisha muundo";
"Set an optional hotkey to swap floaty and fullscreen on demand." = "Weka njia ya mkato ya hiari kubadilisha Floaty na skrini nzima kwa mapenzi.";
"Reset friendly" = "Rejesha kirafiki";
"Use Reset in Settings if you ever want the defaults back." = "Tumia Rejesha katika Mipangilio ikiwa unataka kurudi kwa chaguomsingi.";
"Search & organize" = "Tafuta na panga";
"Type to filter instantly, drag to reorder, and build folders when you need them." = "Andika kuchuja mara moja, buruta kupanga upya, na tengeneza folda unapoihitaji.";
"Instant search" = "Utafutaji wa haraka";
"The search bar narrows results as you type, then Enter launches the first match." = "Ukanda wa utafutaji unapunguza matokeo unapokuwa unaandika, kisha Enter linaweka matokeo ya kwanza.";
"Rearrange easily" = "Panga upya kwa urahisi";
"Drag icons to reorder pages. Hold Option or Shift while dragging to create folders." = "Buruta alama ili kupanga upya kurasa. Shikilia Shift unapoburuta ili kubadilisha nafasi za vipengee, au shikilia Option ili kuunda folda.";
"Name folders fast" = "Panga majina ya folda haraka";
"Drop onto another app to make a folder, then rename it inline." = "Mimina juu ya programu nyingine kutengeneza folda, kisha itaje kwa njia ya ndani.";
"Right-click for power" = "Bofya kulia kwa nguvu";
"Context menus unlock more control wherever you click." = "Menyu za muktadha hufungua udhibiti zaidi popote unakapobofya.";
"App actions" = "Vitendo vya programu";
"Right-click any app to rename it, move pages, hide it, or jump into folders." = "Bofya kulia kwenye programu yoyote kuitangaza jina jipya, kusogeza kurasa, kuificha, au kuingia ndani ya folda.";
"Folder tools" = "Zana za folda";
"Rename, reorder, and move folders between pages with the same menu." = "Badilisha jina, panga upya, na hamisha folda kati ya kurasa kwa menyu hiyo hiyo.";
"Blank canvas" = "Mbao tupu";
"Right-click the background to drop in a new folder whenever you need one." = "Bofya kulia kwenye mandhari kuangusha folda mpya unahitaji.";
